 <h3><u>Moharram na bhoolna</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Dua e fatima zehra ka tumpe saaya hai..(2)<br> Imam e Jafar e sadiq ne ye bataya hai<br> karna khushi bhi lekin..(2)<br> ye ghum na bhoolna..<br> Moharram na bhoolna.. Ya hussain..(4)</p> 
  <p>1. Ghar mein khuda dikhaye tumhare koi khushi<br> shadi ho wo bete ki ya beti ki rukhsati<br> tum bewa e qasim ka..(2)<br> kabhi ghum na bhoolna</p> 
  <p>Moharram na bhulna.. Ya hussain..(4)</p> 
  <p>2. Qayam karo sabeelein azadaro har jagah<br> kausar se kam nahi hai ye paani sabeel ka<br> jaari hai iss sabeel mein..(2)<br> zam zam na bhoolna</p> 
  <p>Moharram na bhulna.. Ya hussain..(4)</p> 
  <p>3. Baqir ke laadle ka imamat ke phool ka<br> farman hai ye Sadiq e Aal e rasool ka<br> jaise ghadeer bhoole..(2)</p> 
  <p>Moharram na bhulna.. Ya hussain..(4)</p> 
  <p>4. Saqqa banao baccho'n ko ghazi ki yaad mein<br> bachpan se hi alam ko utha kar wo chal sakein<br> dooba hua lahu mein..(2)\<br> parcham na bhoolna</p> 
  <p>Moharram na bhulna.. Ya hussain..(4)</p> 
  <p>5. Aaram ke wo din ho ya sakhti ki raat ho<br> ehsaas karbala ka hamesha hi saath ho<br> tum maqtal e hussain ka mausam na bhoolna</p> 
  <p>Moharram na bhulna.. Ya hussain..(4)</p> 
  <p>6. Har haal mein bichana hai farshe ghum e hussain<br> milta hai isse Fatema Zehra ke dil ko chayn<br> zakhme dil e batool ka..(2)<br> marham na bhoolna</p> 
  <p>Moharram na bhulna.. Ya hussain..(4)</p> 
  <p>7. Bedi ho hathkadi ho, ya taboot aur alam<br> saare tabarrukat e hussaini hai mohtaram<br> tazeem inki tum bani..(2)<br> Adam na bhoolna</p> 
  <p>Moharram na bhulna.. Ya hussain..(4)</p> 
  <p>8. Jab apni betiyo'n ko karo pyaar momino<br> shabbir ki yateema ka matam kiya karo<br> khati rahi tamache wo..(2)<br> har dam na bhoolna</p> 
  <p>Moharram na bhulna.. Ya hussain..(4)</p> 
  <p>9. Kufe ke raasto'n mein kabhi shehr e shaam mein<br> bazaar e aam mein kabhi darbaar e aam mein<br> beparda thi jo ghairate...(2)<br> Maryam na bhoolna</p> 
  <p>Moharram na bhulna.. Ya hussain..(4)</p> 
  <p>10. Wajib hai tumpe Mesum o Salman Azmi<br> matam ki janamaz bichaye jo matami<br> nauho'n ki tum azaan pe..(2)<br> matam na bhoolna</p> 
  <p>Moharram na bhulna.. Ya hussain..(4)</p> 
